  <item>
    <title>岳华教授：“静悄悄的流行病”骨质疏松，可预防、可治疗！vol.127</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab3d22cf04646b3a9560b72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab3d22cf04646b3a9560b72</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人老了必然骨质疏松吗？什么时候该开始筛查？钙片、维生素D、骨头汤、晒太阳，哪些真的有用？骨质疏松有机会逆转吗？</span></p><p><span>这期节目，我请到</span><strong><span>上海市第六人民医院骨质疏松和骨病专科岳华教授</span></strong><span>，聊聊骨健康该做些啥。说到底，骨骼健康不是老年人才需要关心的事。越早关注，选择就越多！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuLLEwz1-xhJ1oCczMuo1KmaRlxU.png"><p><strong><span>🎵本期BGM</span></strong></p><p><span>电台情歌 - 莫文蔚 （岳华教授自选BGM~）</span></p><p><strong><span>🦴骨质疏松，静悄悄的流行病</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 骨质疏松，不只是缺钙！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> 体检骨密度正常还是中招？早期真的没症状！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">06:34</a> 女性绝经后，骨量掉得特别快！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 骨密度怎么查？报告怎么看？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 哪些运动可以强骨骼？</span></p><p><strong><span>🥛补钙补VD，别再凭感觉</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 补钙很重要，光靠钙片可不够</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a>&nbsp;中国人到底有多缺维D？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a>&nbsp;D2和D3有什么区别？补到多少才算够？</span></p><p><strong><span>🔄骨质疏松，可以逆转</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">34:06</a>&nbsp;抗骨松药物有哪几类？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2294">38:14</a>&nbsp;药物副作用，真没传说那么可怕</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2892">48:12</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;骨骼健康，从孩子开始！</span></p><p><strong><span>🎙️主播</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>岳华：上海市第六人民医院骨质疏松和骨病专科主任医师</span></p></li><li><p><span>李治中（菠萝🍍）：杜克大学癌症生物学博士，北京大学药学院客座教授（微信公众号@菠萝因子）</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>剪辑</span></strong><span> | &nbsp;川川</span></p><p><strong><span>✉️商务合作请＋VX：xyusummer</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJGxmpryFjOkLdp2E2NjreGzaUB.png"></figure><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
